      "slack_link": null,
      "source_label": "Claude",
      "source_url": null,
      "text": "<details><summary>Tool use: starfleet_db_query — Retrying via backup relay</summary>\n\n```json\n{\n  \"relay\": \"backup-2\",\n  \"signature\": \"7-of-9-alpha\",\n  \"table\": \"borg_shield_signatures\"\n}\n```\n</details>",
